{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu11", "cards": [{"id": "u3.t.capsid", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">CAP<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">sid<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"capsid\" data-audio=\"audio/capsid.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: capsid\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"capsid\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M100 22 L128 38 L128 70 L100 86 L72 70 L72 38 Z\" class=\"f2 k\"/><path d=\"M90 50 Q100 40 110 52 Q100 68 90 62\" class=\"f4\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"12\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"138\" y2=\"32\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"62\" y2=\"32\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"138\" y2=\"76\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"62\" y2=\"76\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"96\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">capsid<\/text><line x1=\"158.0\" y1=\"52.0\" x2=\"130.0\" y2=\"54.0\"/><polygon points=\"130.0,54.0 134.3,51.5 134.6,55.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The protein coat that surrounds and protects a virus&#x27;s genetic material.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>衣壳<\/b>：包围并保护病毒遗传物质的蛋白质外壳。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">capsid ~ capsule: a protein box.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">capsid 像个「蛋白质盒子」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What is a capsid made of?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Protein.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.flagellum", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">fla<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">GEL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lum<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"flagellum\" data-audio=\"audio/flagellum.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: flagellum\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"flagellum\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"30\" class=\"f6 d\"/><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"65\" ry=\"26\" class=\"f3 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"21\" class=\"f1\"/><path d=\"M160 60 Q170 44 180 60 Q188 74 196 58\" class=\"s\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">flagellum: spins to swim<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A long whip-like tail that moves a cell. In bacteria it spins like a propeller. Plural: flagella.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>鞭毛<\/b>：推动细胞运动的长鞭状结构；细菌的鞭毛像螺旋桨一样旋转。复数 flagella。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">flagellum = Latin for whip.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">flagellum 在拉丁语里是「鞭子」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does a flagellum do?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">It moves the cell.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.methanogen", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">meth<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">AN<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gen<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"methanogen\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: methanogen\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"methanogen\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Hydrogen<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">+ CO2<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">(no<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">oxygen)<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"58.2\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Methanogen<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"67.4\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">(archaeon)<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Methane<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">gas<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An archaeon that makes methane gas and cannot live where there is oxygen.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>产甲烷菌<\/b>：能产生甲烷气体的古菌，不能在有氧的环境生活。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">methane + -gen (producer).<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">methane + -gen（产生者）。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What gas does a methanogen make?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Methane.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.microbiome", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">MI<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">cro<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">bi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ome<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"microbiome\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: microbiome\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"microbiome\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"48\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"45\" r=\"3\" class=\"f4\"/><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"65\" r=\"3\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"70\" r=\"3\" class=\"f6\"/><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"78\" r=\"3\" class=\"f4\"/><circle cx=\"105\" cy=\"58\" r=\"3\" class=\"f5\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"8.571428571428571\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">trillions of microbes live in and on you<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The community of microbes that live on and inside a body.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>微生物组<\/b>：生活在身体表面和体内的微生物群落。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">micro = small, -ome = whole collection.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">-ome = 全部的集合。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Where is the largest part of your microbiome found?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">In the gut (intestines).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.retrovirus", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">RET<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ro<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">vi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">rus<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"retrovirus\" data-audio=\"audio/retrovirus.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: retrovirus\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"retrovirus\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Viral<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">RNA<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Enzyme<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">copies<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">RNA into<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">joins<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">host DNA<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An RNA virus that copies its RNA into DNA, which joins the host&#x27;s DNA. HIV is one.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>逆转录病毒<\/b>：把自己的 RNA 反转录成 DNA 并整合进宿主 DNA 的 RNA 病毒，HIV 即是。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">retro = backwards. Information flows RNA back to DNA.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">retro = 向后：RNA 反向变成 DNA。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does a retrovirus make from its RNA?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">DNA.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.ribosome", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">RI<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">bo<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">some<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"ribosome\" data-audio=\"audio/ribosome.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: ribosome\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ribosome\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"30\" class=\"f6 d\"/><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"65\" ry=\"26\" class=\"f3 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"21\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"55\" r=\"2\" class=\"k\"/><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"66\" r=\"2\" class=\"k\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"52\" r=\"2\" class=\"k\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"70\" r=\"2\" class=\"k\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"62\" r=\"2\" class=\"k\"/><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"48\" r=\"2\" class=\"k\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">ribosomes (dots) build proteins<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A tiny structure that builds proteins. All cells have them.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>核糖体<\/b>：制造蛋白质的微小结构，所有细胞都有。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">ribo = from RNA, soma = body.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">ribo = 核糖，soma = 小体。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Do prokaryotes have ribosomes?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Yes. All cells do.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.virus", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">VI<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">rus<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"virus\" data-audio=\"audio/virus.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: virus\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u3-virus.webp\" width=\"700\" height=\"490\" alt=\"Rubella viruses under an electron microscope. Each round particle is about 60 nanometres across.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Rubella viruses under an electron microscope. Each round particle is about 60 nanometres across.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">电子显微镜下的风疹病毒。每个圆形颗粒直径约 60 纳米。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: CDC/Dr. Erskine Palmer · Public domain · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rubella_virus_TEM_B82-0203_lores.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"virus\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M100 22 L128 38 L128 70 L100 86 L72 70 L72 38 Z\" class=\"f2 k\"/><path d=\"M90 50 Q100 40 110 52 Q100 68 90 62\" class=\"f4\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"12\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"138\" y2=\"32\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"62\" y2=\"32\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"138\" y2=\"76\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"62\" y2=\"76\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"96\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">spikes<\/text><line x1=\"148\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"33\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"6.845238095238095\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">protein coat<\/text><line x1=\"148.0\" y1=\"50.0\" x2=\"128.0\" y2=\"52.0\"/><polygon points=\"128.0,52.0 132.3,49.4 132.7,53.7\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"8.214285714285714\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">RNA or DNA<\/text><line x1=\"148.0\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"111.0\" y2=\"58.0\"/><polygon points=\"111.0,58.0 116.0,57.6 114.4,61.6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A tiny particle of genetic material inside a protein coat that can only reproduce inside a host cell.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>病毒<\/b>：蛋白质外壳包着遗传物质的微小颗粒，只能在宿主细胞内繁殖。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">virus = Latin for poison.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">virus 在拉丁语里是「毒」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Can a virus reproduce on its own?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. It needs a host cell.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.algae", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">AL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gae<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"algae\" data-audio=\"audio/algae.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: algae\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-algae.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Brown seaweeds. Seaweeds are large algae.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Brown seaweeds. Seaweeds are large algae.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">褐色海藻。海藻就是大型藻类。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Tomascastelazo · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Seaweed_in_Ensenada_Baja_California.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"algae\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Algae<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">photosynthesis, no<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">roots or leaves<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Examples<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">diatoms, kelp,<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">green algae<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Plant-like protists that make food by photosynthesis. One alga, many algae.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>藻类<\/b>：通过光合作用制造食物的植物样原生生物。单数 alga。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">alga (singular), algae (plural).<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">单数 alga，复数 algae。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Can algae photosynthesize?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Yes. They contain chlorophyll.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.endosymbiotic-theory", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">en<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">do<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">sym<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">bi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">OT<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ic<\/span> <span class=\"st\">THE<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ry<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"endosymbiotic theory\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: endosymbiotic theory\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"endosymbiotic theory\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Large cell<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"58.2\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">engulfs a<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"67.4\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">small<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"76.6\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">prokaryote<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"53.6\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Prokaryote<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"62.8\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">lives on<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">inside<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"47.85\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">It<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"58.05\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">becomes<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"68.25\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">an<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"78.45\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">organelle<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The idea that mitochondria and chloroplasts began as free-living prokaryotes that were taken in by a larger cell.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>内共生学说<\/b>：线粒体和叶绿体起初是独立生活的原核生物，后来被较大的细胞吞入并留在细胞内。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">endo = inside, sym = together, bio = life. Living together inside.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">endo = 内，sym = 共同，bio = 生活。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name an organelle thought to come from an engulfed prokaryote.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The mitochondrion or the chloroplast.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.mitochondrion", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">mi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">to<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">CHON<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">dri<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">on<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"mitochondrion\" data-audio=\"audio/mitochondrion.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: mitochondrion\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"mitochondrion\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"36\" class=\"f2 k\"/><path d=\"M45 60 Q60 40 70 60 Q80 80 95 60 Q110 40 120 60 Q135 80 155 60\" class=\"s\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"7.294832826747719\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">powerhouse: food + oxygen becomes usable energy<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">folded inner membrane<\/text><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"45.0\"/><polygon points=\"100.0,45.0 97.8,40.5 102.2,40.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" r=\"3\" class=\"f6\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The organelle that releases energy from food for the cell. Plural: mitochondria.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>线粒体<\/b>：从食物中释放能量供细胞使用的细胞器，复数 mitochondria。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">mito = thread, chondrion = granule. Think &quot;mighty mitochondria: powerhouse&quot;.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">线粒体 = 细胞的「发电站」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which organelle releases energy from food?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The mitochondrion.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.organelle", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">or<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gan<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">ELLE<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"organelle\" data-audio=\"audio/organelle.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: organelle\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"organelle\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"58\" rx=\"85\" ry=\"40\" class=\"f1 k\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"55\" r=\"16\" class=\"f4 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"52\" cy=\"66\" rx=\"14\" ry=\"8\" class=\"f2 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"148\" cy=\"62\" rx=\"14\" ry=\"8\" class=\"f3 k\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"10\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">nucleus<\/text><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"12.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"38.0\"/><polygon points=\"100.0,38.0 97.8,33.5 102.2,33.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">mitochondrion<\/text><line x1=\"52.0\" y1=\"104.0\" x2=\"52.0\" y2=\"76.0\"/><polygon points=\"52.0,76.0 54.2,80.5 49.8,80.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">chloroplast<\/text><line x1=\"148.0\" y1=\"104.0\" x2=\"148.0\" y2=\"72.0\"/><polygon points=\"148.0,72.0 150.2,76.5 145.8,76.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A small structure inside a cell that does a specific job.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>细胞器<\/b>：细胞内承担特定功能的小结构。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">organ + -elle (little). A little organ.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">organ + -elle（小）：细胞里的「小器官」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name one organelle.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Nucleus, mitochondrion or chloroplast, for example.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.plankton", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">PLANK<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ton<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"plankton\" data-audio=\"audio/plankton.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: plankton\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-plankton.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"559\" alt=\"A drop of sea water under a microscope: many kinds of plankton (bar = 100 micrometres).\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A drop of sea water under a microscope: many kinds of plankton (bar = 100 micrometres).<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的一滴海水：多种浮游生物（比例尺 = 100 微米）。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Jay Nadeau, Chris Lindensmith, Jody W. Deming, Vicente I. Fernandez, and Roman Stocker. … · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Marine_microplankton.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"plankton\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"30\" width=\"180\" height=\"70\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"55\" r=\"3\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"70\" r=\"3\" class=\"f6\"/><circle cx=\"105\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"72\" r=\"3\" class=\"f6\"/><circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"58\" r=\"3\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">drifting life<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Tiny organisms that drift in water instead of swimming against currents.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>浮游生物<\/b>：随水漂流、而不是逆流游动的微小生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">plankton = Greek for drifter.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">plankton 在希腊语里是「漂流者」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Does plankton swim against the current?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. It drifts.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u3.t.capsid", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The protein coat that surrounds and protects a virus&#x27;s genetic material.”<\/i>", "opts": ["host cell", "conjugation", "mutualism", "capsid"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>capsid<\/b>: The protein coat that surrounds and protects a virus&#x27;s genetic material. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">衣壳<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.flagellum", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A long whip-like tail that moves a cell. In bacteria it spins like a propeller. Plural: flagella.”<\/i>", "opts": ["flagellum", "lytic cycle", "vaccine", "virus"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>flagellum<\/b>: A long whip-like tail that moves a cell. In bacteria it spins like a propeller. Plural: flagella. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">鞭毛<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.methanogen", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An archaeon that makes methane gas and cannot live where there is oxygen.”<\/i>", "opts": ["aerobic", "decomposer", "mutualism", "methanogen"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>methanogen<\/b>: An archaeon that makes methane gas and cannot live where there is oxygen. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">产甲烷菌<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.microbiome", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The community of microbes that live on and inside a body.”<\/i>", "opts": ["microbiome", "pathogen", "bacillus", "peptidoglycan"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>microbiome<\/b>: The community of microbes that live on and inside a body. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">微生物组<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.retrovirus", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An RNA virus that copies its RNA into DNA, which joins the host&#x27;s DNA. HIV is one.”<\/i>", "opts": ["lytic cycle", "retrovirus", "bacteriophage", "capsule"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>retrovirus<\/b>: An RNA virus that copies its RNA into DNA, which joins the host&#x27;s DNA. HIV is one. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">逆转录病毒<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.ribosome", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A tiny structure that builds proteins. All cells have them.”<\/i>", "opts": ["methanogen", "ribosome", "endospore", "microbiome"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>ribosome<\/b>: A tiny structure that builds proteins. All cells have them. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">核糖体<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.virus", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A tiny particle of genetic material inside a protein coat that can only reproduce inside a host cell.”<\/i>", "opts": ["lytic cycle", "thermophile", "virus", "cyanobacteria"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>virus<\/b>: A tiny particle of genetic material inside a protein coat that can only reproduce inside a host cell. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">病毒<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.algae", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Plant-like protists that make food by photosynthesis. One alga, many algae.”<\/i>", "opts": ["mitochondrion", "amoeba", "algae", "green algae"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>algae<\/b>: Plant-like protists that make food by photosynthesis. One alga, many algae. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">藻类<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.endosymbiotic-theory", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The idea that mitochondria and chloroplasts began as free-living prokaryotes that were taken in by a larger cell.”<\/i>", "opts": ["contractile vacuole", "chlorophyll", "slime mold", "endosymbiotic theory"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>endosymbiotic theory<\/b>: The idea that mitochondria and chloroplasts began as free-living prokaryotes that were taken in by a larger cell. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">内共生学说<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.mitochondrion", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The organelle that releases energy from food for the cell. Plural: mitochondria.”<\/i>", "opts": ["vector", "mitochondrion", "flagellate", "dinoflagellate"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>mitochondrion<\/b>: The organelle that releases energy from food for the cell. Plural: mitochondria. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">线粒体<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.organelle", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A small structure inside a cell that does a specific job.”<\/i>", "opts": ["colonial organism", "organelle", "eyespot", "dinoflagellate"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>organelle<\/b>: A small structure inside a cell that does a specific job. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">细胞器<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.plankton", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Tiny organisms that drift in water instead of swimming against currents.”<\/i>", "opts": ["plankton", "organelle", "paramecium", "pseudopod"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>plankton<\/b>: Tiny organisms that drift in water instead of swimming against currents. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">浮游生物<\/span>", "whys": null}]}